        title: "Martlets Society Minutes of 12 March and 14 June 1919",
        printedIn: "Walter Hooper, “To the Martlets,” <i>C.S. Lewis: Speaker and Teacher,</i> ed. Carolyn Keefe (Grand Rapids: Zondervan)",
